C's PURPLE launcher. If you buy a Founder's Pack, you get in early ...\",\"image\":[\"/cdn/blog/aion-2/aion-2-release-date/featured.jpg\"],\"datePublished\":\"2026-09-01T01:08:03.897Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-09-24T03:01:48.326Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://timesaver.gg/author/sam-okonkwo#person\",\"name\":\"Sam Okonkwo\",\"url\":\"https://timesaver.gg/author/sam-okonkwo\",\"image\":\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1YTVmNmucIYiPcfI8tbQR5SHbjlCjuVHj=w512\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Timesaver.gg Editorial Team\"}}","id":"article-jsonld"}])</script><script>(self.__next_s=self.__next_s||[]).push([0,{"type":"application/ld+json","children":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://timesaver.gg/blog/aion-2-release-date#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When does AION 2 come out?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"AION 2 launches globally on October 5, 2026, free-to-play on PC via Steam and PURPLE. Founder's Pack owners get in five days early, from September 30.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What time do AION 2 servers open?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"NC has not published an exact server-open time or timezone for either the September 30 head start or the October 5 launch. Don't trust any page that lists a specific hour — none has been officially confirmed yet. We'll update this page the moment NC posts one.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is AION 2 early access worth it?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The Founder's Pack head start (September 30–October 4) is the only functional benefit of the packs — everything else is cosmetic. If a five-day levelling head start and a title matter to you, the $24.99 Standard pack delivers exactly the same early access as the $99.99 Ultimate. If you just want to play the game, waiting for the free October 5 launch costs you nothing but five days.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is AION 2 free to play?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. There's no purchase required to play. There is an optional $15/month Membership that unlocks the in-game Market and the Kina ↔ Quna currency exchange, but you can level and play the whole game without it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is AION 2 coming to mobile or console?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not for the global launch. Mobile (iOS/Android) exists only in Korea and Taiwan, and no Western mobile or console version has been announced. Global AION 2 is PC-only.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Did AION 2's release date get delayed?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. It was originally targeting a September 2026 window, and NC moved it to October 5, 2026, confirming the new date at Gamescom on August 25. A further slip is always possible until servers are live, so we treat the date as \\\"currently scheduled.\\\"\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is AION 2 the same as Aion or Aion Classic?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No — it's a separate, brand-new game built in Unreal Engine 5. It shares the Atreia setting and faction names with the 2008 original, but the systems are rebuilt. \\\"Aion 2.0\\\" is a misspelling, not a different product.\"}}]}","id":"faq-jsonld"}])</script><article><header class="flex flex-wrap xl:flex-nowrap items-end gap-4"><h1 itemProp="headline" class="font-bold text-xl-32 lg:text-xl-36 leading-xl-28 lg:leading-xl-32 -tracking-[0.07em] mt-4
            md:mt-5 min-w-[60%]">AION 2 Release Date: Early Access, Launch Windows &amp; Everything NC Has Confirmed</h1><aside class="flex items-center justify-between w-full"><a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/review/timesaver.gg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-3 font-gosha text-[13px] leading-base tracking-tighter text-white-200
              bg-black-300 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg">Review us on<img alt="Trust Pilot" loading="lazy" width="74" height="18" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/immutable/media/trust-logo.38jxkdrj5ev5m.svg"/></a><a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/review/timesaver.gg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-max"><img alt="trust pilot" loading="lazy" width="116" height="58" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mx-auto" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/immutable/media/trust-pilot.1pqv69xepap3t.svg"/><div class="text-center mt-2 font-gosha font-normal text-md-14 leading-base text-gray-400
                tracking-normal">Excellent 4.9/5</div></a></aside></header><div class="flex items-center gap-4 mt-6 mb-8"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><img alt="Sam Okonkwo" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="rounded-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Flh3.googleusercontent.com%2Fd%2F1YTVmNmucIYiPcfI8tbQR5SHbjlCjuVHj%3Dw512&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Flh3.googleusercontent.com%2Fd%2F1YTVmNmucIYiPcfI8tbQR5SHbjlCjuVHj%3Dw512&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Flh3.googleusercontent.com%2Fd%2F1YTVmNmucIYiPcfI8tbQR5SHbjlCjuVHj%3Dw512&amp;w=96&amp;q=75"/><div><a class="font-medium text-white" href="/author/sam-okonkwo">Sam Okonkwo</a><p class="text-sm text-gray-400 hidden lg:block">Senior Games Writer</p></div></div><div class="h-6 w-px bg-gray-700"></div><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400"><time dateTime="2026-09-01T01:08:03.897Z" class="text-gray-400">Published on <!-- -->September 1, 2026</time><span class="hidden sm:inline text-gray-600">•</span><time dateTime="2026-09-24T03:01:48.326Z" class="text-gray-400 text-xs" title="Last modified: 9/24/2026">Updated <!-- -->September 24, 2026</time></div></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row gap-5 mt-7.5"><section id="blog" class="flex-grow"><div itemProp="articleBody" class="bg-reviews-gradient rounded-2xl px-10 py-4"><img alt="AION 2 Release Date: Early Access, Launch Windows &amp; Everything NC Has Confirmed" loading="lazy" width="900" height="900" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mb-4" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fcdn%2Fblog%2Faion-2%2Faion-2-release-date%2Ffeatured.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fcdn%2Fblog%2Faion-2%2Faion-2-release-date%2Ffeatured.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fcdn%2Fblog%2Faion-2%2Faion-2-release-date%2Ffeatured.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/><div><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> AION 2 launches globally on <strong>October 5, 2026</strong>, free-to-play on PC via <strong>Steam and NC&#39;s PURPLE launcher</strong>. If you buy a <strong>Founder&#39;s Pack</strong>, you get in early — <strong>5 days of Advance Access from September 30 through October 4</strong>. Before either of those, NC is running a <strong>two-day Launch Scale Test on September 17–18</strong> that anyone can sign up for on the Steam page. One thing NC has <strong>not</strong> published yet: the exact server-open <strong>clock time</strong> for either the head start or launch day. Everything below is what&#39;s confirmed, what changed, and what&#39;s still a question mark — verified against NC&#39;s official channels as of August 31, 2026. <a href="https://timesaver.gg/blog/aion-2-servers">AION 2 servers and regions</a></p>
<p>AION 2 is one of the most-searched unreleased games of the year, and the search results for it are a mess — half of them are about the <em>original</em> 2008 Aion, the rest are grey-market sellers guessing at dates. This is the clean version. We&#39;re tracking every official announcement from NC (NCSoft), the <a href="https://aion2.plaync.com/en-us" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">official AION 2 site</a>, and the <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393110/" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Steam store page</a>, and we update this page the moment a date or time lands.</p>
<h2>When does AION 2 release?</h2>
<p><strong>AION 2 releases worldwide on October 5, 2026.</strong> That&#39;s the free-to-play launch — the day the servers open to everyone, no purchase required. NC confirmed the date at <strong>Gamescom 2026 Opening Night Live on August 25, 2026</strong>, and it&#39;s listed as the release date on the Steam store page for the game (AppID 3393110).</p>
<p>Two things to know about that date:</p>
<ul class="list-bullet"><li value="1"><strong>It moved.</strong> AION 2 was originally targeting a <strong>September 2026</strong> window. NC pushed it to October 5 and outlets covered it explicitly as a delay. That matters because a game that has already slipped once <em>can</em> slip again — until the servers are physically up, treat the date as &quot;currently scheduled&quot; rather than carved in stone.</li><li value="2"><strong>It&#39;s a single global launch date.</strong> NC has not detailed staggered per-region unlock times. There are reported plans for separate service regions (North America, South America, Europe, Asia/Japan), but NC has <strong>not</strong> published a server list or per-region launch clock, so don&#39;t assume your region opens at a different hour than everyone else&#39;s — we simply don&#39;t know yet.</li></ul>
<p>For context on how far along this game already is: AION 2 <strong>launched in South Korea and Taiwan on November 19, 2025</strong>, on PC, iOS and Android. So the game itself is real, shipped, and roughly nine months into its life in Asia. What launches on October 5 is the <strong>global build</strong>, which NC reworked from the Korean version — the two are separate services.</p>
<h2>When is AION 2 early access? (Founder&#39;s Pack head start)</h2>
<p><a href="https://timesaver.gg/blog/aion-2-early-access"><strong>Advance Access starts September 30, 2026, and runs through October 4</strong></a> — a five-day head start before the free-to-play launch. The official Steam Founder&#39;s Pack page (AppID 4972180) states <strong>&quot;Advance Access Starts 30 Sep,&quot;</strong> and NC&#39;s press release describes it as <em>&quot;five days of early access starting September 30.&quot;</em></p>
<p>Here&#39;s the important part, because it&#39;s the single most-asked question about the packs: <strong>the only way to get early access is to buy a Founder&#39;s Pack, and the head start is the only functional thing the packs give you.</strong> Everything else in them is cosmetic. There are three tiers, and you can buy <strong>only one per account</strong>:</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Price (USD)</th><th>What you get beyond the 5-day head start</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Standard</strong></td><td><strong>$24.99</strong></td><td>Daeva&#39;s Campaign Supply Chest + a &quot;Vanguard of Atreia&quot; title</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Deluxe</strong></td><td><strong>$49.99</strong></td><td>Standard + &quot;Ascended Daeva&quot; armor skin + &quot;Eternal Sun&quot; weapon skin</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ultimate</strong></td><td><strong>$99.99</strong></td><td>Deluxe + Styling Chest + &quot;Moonlit Aria&quot; armor skin + &quot;Black Dragon&quot; pet + &quot;Blazing Sun&quot; wings</td></tr></tbody></table>
<p>(USD prices from NC&#39;s press release; EUR pricing on the Steam page runs €21.25 / €42.49 / €84.99.) So if you only care about <em>playing sooner</em>, the $24.99 Standard pack buys you the same five days as the $99.99 one — the difference is purely skins, a pet and wings.</p>
<blockquote><p><strong>One thing we&#39;re still verifying:</strong> the Steam Founder&#39;s Pack page currently also lists what reads as a <strong>30-day Membership</strong> entitlement in the Standard tier, which did <strong>not</strong> appear in NC&#39;s July press release. Membership is a big deal in AION 2 (it unlocks the in-game Market), so if a pack really does include 30 days of it, that changes the value math a lot. We&#39;re not stating it as fact until NC confirms it directly — check back.</p></blockquote>
<p><strong>Is early access worth it?</strong> If you&#39;re a launch-day-hype player who wants a head start on levelling and a title, yes. If you&#39;re mostly a PvE player worried about being &quot;stuck&quot; on a low-population early-access server, know that veterans of the Korean and Taiwanese versions report the game is heavily instanced — as one long-time TW player put it, <em>&quot;if you enjoy PvE, you will be able to play all dungeons with people from the launch server… you will not be isolated.&quot;</em> We can&#39;t verify that for the global build until it&#39;s live, but it&#39;s the consistent read from people who&#39;ve actually played.</p>
<p><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1v8iHvcCNodaJyo84H9y672kwDBMJZyBk=w1600" alt="AION 2 fiery winged boss encounter"></p>
<h2>The full AION 2 release timeline</h2>
<p>Here&#39;s every confirmed date in one place, in order:</p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Event</th><th>Date</th><th>Platform / notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>AION 2 launch — South Korea &amp; Taiwan</td><td><strong>November 19, 2025</strong></td><td>PC + mobile (Asia only)</td></tr><tr><td>NC announces the global PC release</td><td><strong>June 2026</strong></td><td>Summer Game Fest window</td></tr><tr><td>Official global business-model notice</td><td><strong>July 8, 2026</strong></td><td>The &quot;$15 Membership&quot; reveal</td></tr><tr><td>Founder&#39;s Packs go on sale</td><td><strong>July 22, 2026</strong></td><td>Steam + PURPLE</td></tr><tr><td>Gamescom announcement — October 5 date locked</td><td><strong>August 25, 2026</strong></td><td>Opening Night Live</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Launch Scale Test</strong></td><td><strong>September 17–18, 2026</strong></td><td>Free, sign up on Steam</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Founder&#39;s Pack Advance Access</strong></td><td><strong>September 30 – October 4, 2026</strong></td><td>Buyers only, 5-day head start</td></tr><tr><td><strong>GLOBAL LAUNCH (free-to-play)</strong></td><td><strong>October 5, 2026</strong></td><td>PC — Steam + PURPLE</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h2>What time do AION 2 servers go live?</h2>
<p><strong>NC has not published an exact server-open time for either September 30 or October 5.</strong> No official source has given an hour and timezone for the head-start server open or the launch-day server open as of this writing.</p>
<p>This is the honest answer, and it&#39;s worth saying plainly because a lot of pages will invent a time to fill the gap — don&#39;t trust those. The moment NC posts an official server-open time on the <a href="https://aion2.plaync.com/en-us" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">AION 2 notice board</a> or the Steam page, we&#39;ll update this section with the exact hour for each major timezone (PT / ET / CEST / KST). Bookmark this page if that&#39;s what you&#39;re here for.</p>
<h2>What is the AION 2 Launch Scale Test?</h2>
<p>Before either launch date, NC is running a <strong>Launch Scale Test on September 17–18, 2026</strong> — a short, server-stress test open to everyone, not just Founder&#39;s Pack owners. You sign up through the AION 2 Steam page, download the test client during a pre-download window, and play inside the published test windows.</p>
<p>The exact test hours were circulating in aggregator coverage but had <strong>not</strong> been confirmed word-for-word from NC&#39;s official post at the time of writing, so we&#39;re not printing specific clock times for it yet — check the official Steam news post for AppID 3393110 for the confirmed windows before you plan your evening around it. What it <em>is</em> good for: a legitimate, no-cost way to actually touch the global build two-and-a-half weeks before launch, test your PC&#39;s performance, and try a class before you commit.</p>
<h2>What platforms is AION 2 on?</h2>
<p><strong>The global launch is PC-only.</strong> Steam lists Windows only — no macOS, no Linux — and you can play through <strong>either Steam or PURPLE</strong>, NC&#39;s own launcher and platform. Both are official; pick whichever you prefer.</p>
<p>A few platform questions that come up constantly:</p>
<ul class="list-bullet"><li value="1"><strong>Is AION 2 on mobile?</strong> Not for the global launch. iOS and Android versions exist, but <strong>only in Korea and Taiwan</strong>. NC has not announced a Western mobile release, so there is no global &quot;AION 2 mobile release date&quot; — anyone claiming one is guessing.</li><li value="2"><strong>Is AION 2 on console (PS5 / Xbox / Switch)?</strong> No, and NC has not announced a console version.</li><li value="3"><strong>Will my Korean or Taiwanese character transfer to global?</strong> No transfer has been announced. The global service is separate from the KR/TW service; treat your global account as a fresh start.</li></ul>
<p><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1_73k-irjQRJ5UhRoc2sLMXlWX2HRr72D=w1600" alt="AION 2 real-time party combat"></p>
<h2>Is AION 2 free to play?</h2>
<p><strong>Yes — AION 2 is free-to-play at launch.</strong> No box price, no mandatory subscription just to log in and play. It&#39;s listed as Free-to-Play with in-app purchases on Steam.</p>
<p>The nuance — and it&#39;s a big one — is an <strong>optional $15/month Membership.</strong> In NC&#39;s official July 8 business-model notice, the Membership unlocks the in-game <strong>Market</strong> (the auction house) and the <strong>Kina ↔ Quna Exchange</strong> (a first-party currency conversion, similar in spirit to a WoW Token). In other words, free players can play the whole game, but the <em>trading economy</em> sits behind the Membership. That&#39;s the detail veterans argue about most — many consider $15 a fair price to unlock the market, while critics point out that free players effectively can&#39;t build up a currency reserve by selling loot. We&#39;ll have a full breakdown of the Membership and what it gates in a dedicated guide; for the release date, the headline is simple: <strong>you do not have to pay anything to play AION 2 on October 5.</strong></p>
<h2>Is AION 2 the same as the original Aion?</h2>
<p><strong>No.</strong> This trips up almost everyone searching, so it&#39;s worth being blunt: <strong>AION 2, the original Aion (2008), and Aion Classic are three different games.</strong></p>
<ul class="list-bullet"><li value="1"><strong>AION 2</strong> (2026) is a brand-new MMORPG built in Unreal Engine 5, launching globally October 5, 2026.</li><li value="2"><strong>Aion</strong> (2008, &quot;Aion: The Tower of Eternity&quot;) is the original — still running, not the same game.</li><li value="3"><strong>Aion Classic</strong> is NC&#39;s rolled-back re-release of that original — also not AION 2.</li></ul>
<p>They share a universe (the world of Atreia, the <a href="https://timesaver.gg/blog/aion-2-elyos-or-asmodian">Elyos or Asmodian</a> factions, winged Daeva heroes) and a lot of the same terminology, which is exactly why the search results are so muddled. But AION 2 rebuilt the systems from the ground up. NC&#39;s own marketing describes it as <em>&quot;a world 36 times larger than the original&quot;</em> with <em>&quot;over 200 dungeons&quot;</em> — treat those as NC&#39;s claims rather than measured facts, but the point stands: this is a new game, not a patch or a remaster.</p>
<p>You&#39;ll also see the query <strong>&quot;Aion 2.0&quot;</strong> thrown around. That&#39;s a misspelling that collides with a 2010 patch for the <em>original</em> Aion — it is not the name of this game. If you searched &quot;Aion 2.0 release date,&quot; you&#39;re in the right place: it&#39;s October 5, 2026.</p>
<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>When does AION 2 come out?</strong> AION 2 launches globally on October 5, 2026, free-to-play on PC via Steam and PURPLE. Founder&#39;s Pack owners get in five days early, from September 30.</p>
<p><strong>What time do AION 2 servers open?</strong> NC has not published an exact server-open time or timezone for either the September 30 head start or the October 5 launch. Don&#39;t trust any page that lists a specific hour — none has been officially confirmed yet. We&#39;ll update this page the moment NC posts one.</p>
<p><strong>Is AION 2 early access worth it?</strong> The Founder&#39;s Pack head start (September 30–October 4) is the only functional benefit of the packs — everything else is cosmetic. If a five-day levelling head start and a title matter to you, the $24.99 Standard pack delivers exactly the same early access as the $99.99 Ultimate. If you just want to play the game, waiting for the free October 5 launch costs you nothing but five days.</p>
<p><strong>Is AION 2 free to play?</strong> Yes. There&#39;s no purchase required to play. There is an optional $15/month Membership that unlocks the in-game Market and the Kina ↔ Quna currency exchange, but you can level and play the whole game without it.</p>
<p><strong>Is AION 2 coming to mobile or console?</strong> Not for the global launch. Mobile (iOS/Android) exists only in Korea and Taiwan, and no Western mobile or console version has been announced. Global AION 2 is PC-only.</p>
<p><strong>Did AION 2&#39;s release date get delayed?</strong> Yes. It was originally targeting a September 2026 window, and NC moved it to October 5, 2026, confirming the new date at Gamescom on August 25. A further slip is always possible until servers are live, so we treat the date as &quot;currently scheduled.&quot;</p>
<p><strong>Is AION 2 the same as Aion or Aion Classic?</strong> No — it&#39;s a separate, brand-new game built in Unreal Engine 5. It shares the Atreia setting and faction names with the 2008 original, but the systems are rebuilt. &quot;Aion 2.0&quot; is a misspelling, not a different product.</p>
<h2>The bottom line</h2>
<p>Mark two dates: <strong>September 30</strong> if you&#39;re buying a Founder&#39;s Pack for the head start, and <strong>October 5</strong> for the free global launch. Sign up for the <strong>September 17–18 Launch Scale Test</strong> on Steam if you want to try the global build early and stress-test your PC. The one detail still missing is the exact server-open time — NC hasn&#39;t given one, and we&#39;ll update this page the instant it does.</p>
<blockquote><p><strong>Looking for the fastest way to gear up and progress once AION 2 goes live?</strong> timesaver.gg runs boosting, currency and carry services across 19+ live games — and we&#39;ll be tracking AION 2 as the global economy takes shape.</p></blockquote>
